# Allowlist: exclude everything, then include only what Containerfiles need.
*

# Go workspace
!go.work
!go.work.sum

# Go components (full source for those that are cross-module dependencies)
!fulfillment-service/
!bare-metal-fulfillment-operator/
!osac-operator/
!osac-csi-driver/
!osac-metering/

# Shared proto module: every Containerfile now COPYs proto/ for the single
# generated Go tree at proto/gen/ that all components import.
!proto/

# osac-ui: full source, not just proxy/ -- its Containerfile now copies
# go.work from the repo root too (see its own comment for why), which
# requires repo-root build context. Re-exclude the same build artifacts
# and secrets-bearing files osac-ui/.containerignore used to cover on its
# own when it was a standalone build context.
!osac-ui/
osac-ui/**/node_modules
osac-ui/**/dist
osac-ui/**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
osac-ui/.env
osac-ui/.env.*
